  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.12.0:\n      - Adds AstraFlow.OpenTelemetry with ActivitySource tracing, request and notification metrics, validation finding metrics, and redacted telemetry defaults.\n      - Adds telemetry disable and sampling switches plus documented span and metric names.\n      - Adds observability tests, documentation, packaging, workflow, and clean-install verification for the OpenTelemetry integration package.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
